    "title": "Things to Do, DMV: Weekend Rundown, Sept. 17-21 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jada Ingleton ,\n1 days ago The Washington Informer Calendar highlights several upcoming events in the DMV area following the Congressional Black Caucus Foundation 55th Annual Legislative Conference, including the National Policy Alliance meeting, the Friendship Place 35th Anniversary Gala, Public Policy Talks Live D.C. 2026, H Street Festival 2026, Broccoli City Festival, Dope Black Girls Brunch 2026, and Fiesta de la Familia. The post Things to Do, DMV: Weekend Rundown, Sept. 17-21 appeared first on The Washington Informer . Read full article",
